Package: gxde-nighttime-x11
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends:
 geoclue-2.0,
 libqt6positioning6-plugins,
Description: dark-light cycle scheduling service for GXDE
 KNightTime provides helpers for scheduling the dark-light cycle. It can be
 used to implement features such as adjusting the screen color temperature
 based on time of day.
 .
 gxde-nighttime-x11 is GXDE's build of KNightTime for the Qt 6.8 and KDE
 Frameworks 6.13 stack of GXDE 25. Its library, CMake package, include
 directory, daemon, D-Bus name, systemd unit and configuration files use
 GXDE-specific names so that it can be installed next to the distribution
 knighttime packages.
 .
 This package contains the gxde-nighttime-x11d D-Bus service
 (com.gxde.NightTimeX11). Automatic location needs geoclue and the Qt
 Positioning plugins.

Package: libgxde-nighttime-x11-0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends:
 gxde-nighttime-x11 (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: dark-light cycle scheduling helpers for GXDE - shared library
 KNightTime provides helpers for scheduling the dark-light cycle. It can be
 used to implement features such as adjusting the screen color temperature
 based on time of day.
 .
 gxde-nighttime-x11 is GXDE's build of KNightTime for the Qt 6.8 and KDE
 Frameworks 6.13 stack of GXDE 25. Its library, CMake package, include
 directory, daemon, D-Bus name, systemd unit and configuration files use
 GXDE-specific names so that it can be installed next to the distribution
 knighttime packages.
 .
 This package contains the client library, which subscribes to schedule
 updates from the gxde-nighttime-x11d service.

